flowchart LR
    P[Principal\nissues bounded authority]
    subgraph M[Maritime isolated agent runtime]
      L[LangChain agent\nbusiness arguments only]
      I[Ratify interceptor\nchallenge + presentation]
      L -->|selected work-order tool| I
    end
    subgraph R[Separately configured receiver runtime]
      C[Challenge endpoint]
      U[Bounded proof upload]
      O[One-time proof registry]
      MCP[Streamable HTTP MCP tool]
      V[Ratify verification\nplus receiver policy]
      H[Protected handler]
      U --> O
      MCP -->|atomically resolve reference| O
      O --> V -->|ALLOW only| H
    end
    P -->|signed delegation| I
    I -->|1. BIND: exact-action challenge| C
    I -->|2. PRESENT: proof body; receive opaque reference| U
    I -->|3. CALL: business action + short reference| MCP
    V -.->|DENY: stable reason, handler unchanged| MCP
